{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Yes Sir you command your little army of roman soldiers to their target positions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up! Down! Left! Right!<br>What starts as a simple mechanic will make your brain smoke after some time.<br>Especially after the levels get larger and larger and additional block types such as different soldiers, two-direction fences, and one-direction stairs make the options to consider more and more complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compare your solution to the performance of other commanders out there and figure out the optimal solution for each of the more than 200 levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your soldiers are awaiting your orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520670/extras/34b90c605c6b0d0e0f449d1bbad6925a.poster.avif?t=1743530644\" width=528 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520670/extras/34b90c605c6b0d0e0f449d1bbad6925a.webm?t=1743530644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520670/extras/34b90c605c6b0d0e0f449d1bbad6925a.mp4?t=1743530644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 200 levels in 5 levels of difficulty. Ranging from easy to expert level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadlock free puzzles.<br>Even if you make a wrong move. The levels are setup such that you can always still reach the goal. <i>All roads lead to Rome!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level stats<br>Compare your solution to the solution of other players.<br>See how many moves it took other players to solve the level. <br>Optimize your solution until you reach an optimal solution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements<br>Strive for completing in game milestones and be rewarded by a multitude of achievements.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are your ready for your adventure? <br>Your soldiers are waiting. At your command!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Level","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3520670/3947ef61f11ec8165203fa3407880db05a8f8c32.jpg"},{"name":"10 Levels Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3520670/48ff16e99336081d9b399a992f3a0827e8a67cb9.jpg"},{"name":"20 Levels Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3520670/1c96ef0065d1586e20250f4f26caaebcc0a1dfa2.jpg"},{"name":"50 Levels Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3520670/8a72ecb88408ad53be8317cb93cab25e48ed0f64.jpg"},{"name":"100 Levels Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3520670/3ea574ce433eb5bee84074ef5b36162cc15afa4b.jpg"},{"name":"Hastatus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3520670/17e15ce7f7c5b77000506968c347136f13655b4b.jpg"},{"name":"Signifer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3520670/255f0a7bfbd2f1b55891ac4acc27dd8aaf094d7c.jpg"},{"name":"Optio","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3520670/ea0398bcca09a333b56a23990a79d8060cdc8bff.jpg"},{"name":"Centurio","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3520670/2df2acdef5fe9f8caba6d78f0fa52173cdb7053a.jpg"},{"name":"Legatus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3520670/c77784f326a4b901eab67fd061ee80e32d676e33.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3520670?t=1743530644","background_raw":"https://st